<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  launchd wiring for iak-pending on a timer (opt-in, one per machine).

  What it does: every 30 minutes it asks every daemon the fleet knows about what
  is still waiting on the owner, and posts to the room only the items that have
  been waiting at least 2 hours - and only when an item reaches a NEW escalation
  (2h, then 4h, 8h, 16h). A card raised in the room scrolls away in minutes;
  this is what still remembers it four hours later. See README, "What is still
  waiting on you".

  StartInterval, not KeepAlive: this is a one-shot per tick, and on a laptop
  that sleeps an in-process timer stalls across sleep while launchd re-runs on
  wake.

  Install (launchd cannot expand $HOME, so bake the checkout path in with sed):
    mkdir -p ~/Library/LaunchAgents
    sed "s|REPLACE_WITH_IAK_ROOT|$HOME/ide-agent-kit|g" \
      examples/pending-launchd.plist \
      > ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.thinkoff.iak-pending.plist
    launchctl load ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.thinkoff.iak-pending.plist

  Before you load it, run it once by hand WITHOUT --room and read the output:
    node bin/iak-pending.mjs --older-than 2h
  Exit codes: 0 all clear (and every host answered), 10 something is waiting,
  11 a host could not be asked, 12 none could, 2 cannot run. Only 0 is clear.

  Anti-nag: the ledger at IAK_PENDING_STATE_FILE is what stops a repeat post.
  Deleting it does NOT cause a storm - the next run rebuilds it and stays
  silent for that tick, on purpose.

  Raise --older-than if the room feels busy; there is no cooldown to tune,
  because escalations are what trigger a post, not elapsed time.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
  <key>Label</key>
  <string>com.thinkoff.iak-pending</string>
  <key>ProgramArguments</key>
  <array>
    <string>/bin/bash</string>
    <string>-c</string>
    <string>cd REPLACE_WITH_IAK_ROOT &amp;&amp; exec node bin/iak-pending.mjs --older-than 2h --room</string>
  </array>
  <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
  <dict>
    <key>PATH</key>
    <string>/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin</string>
    <key>IAK_CONFIG</key>
    <string>REPLACE_WITH_IAK_ROOT/ide-agent-kit.json</string>
    <key>IAK_WATCHDOG_ROSTER_FILE</key>
    <string>REPLACE_WITH_IAK_ROOT/config/watchdog-roster.json</string>
    <key>IAK_PENDING_STATE_FILE</key>
    <string>REPLACE_WITH_IAK_ROOT/.iak-pending-announced.json</string>
  </dict>
  <key>RunAtLoad</key>
  <true/>
  <key>StartInterval</key>
  <integer>1800</integer>
  <key>StandardOutPath</key>
  <string>/tmp/iak-pending.launchd.log</string>
  <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
  <string>/tmp/iak-pending.launchd.log</string>
</dict>
</plist>
